/**
 * appendToFlowVariable
 * --------------------
 * Compile-time helper to append element(s) to **array** Flow variables.
 *
 * Quick usage
 * ```ts
 * appendToFlowVariable(Now.ID.flow1, vars, { processIds: ['4'] })
 * ```
 *
 * Rules
 * • Keys in `_values` must reference array-typed variables.
 * • Each value can be a single element, an array of elements, or a template
 *   string compatible with the element type.
 *
 * Erased at runtime – exists purely for type-checking.
 *
 * Parameters
 * ----------
 * @param _context   Context object containing the runtime identifier for these variables and annotation.
 * @param _variables Schema created via {@link FlowVariables}.
 * @param _values    Partial map where each key is an array-typed variable
 *                   name and the corresponding value(s) to append.
 */
